<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="th">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>Geomancy Luxury Dashboard</title>
    <style>
        @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cinzel:wght@400;700&family=Prompt:wght@300;400&display=swap');

        body { 
            background: radial-gradient(circle at center, #1a1a1a 0%, #000 100%);
            color: #d4af37; font-family: 'Prompt', sans-serif;
            display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center; min-height: 100vh; margin: 0;
        }
        .container { 
            width: 800px; padding: 40px; border: 1px solid #d4af37; 
            background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
            box-shadow: 0 0 50px rgba(212,175,55,0.2); text-align: center;
        }
        h1 { font-family: 'Cinzel', serif; letter-spacing: 5px; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 30px; }
        .grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); gap: 20px; margin: 30px 0; }
        .box { border: 1px solid #555; padding: 15px; transition: 0.3s; }
        .box:hover { border-color: #d4af37; transform: translateY(-5px); }
        .dots { font-size: 1.8em; color: #fff; line-height: 1.2; }
        .label { font-size: 0.8em; letter-spacing: 2px; margin-bottom: 10px; color: #aaa; }
        .verdict { font-size: 1.5em; border-top: 1px solid #d4af37; padding-top: 20px; margin-top: 20px; font-family: 'Cinzel', serif; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="container">
    <h1>Geomancy Oracle</h1>
    <p>คำถาม: แนวโน้มการเทรด XAUUSD สำหรับคุณมิ้กกี้</p>

    <div class="grid">
        <div class="box"><div class="label">MOTHERS</div><div class="dots">●<br>●<br>●<br>●</div><p>VIA</p></div>
        <div class="box"><div class="label">MOTHERS</div><div class="dots">●●<br>●●<br>●●<br>●●</div><p>POPULUS</p></div>
        <div class="box"><div class="label">MOTHERS</div><div class="dots">●●<br>●<br>●<br>●●</div><p>CONJUNCTIO</p></div>
        <div class="box"><div class="label">MOTHERS</div><div class="dots">●●<br>●<br>●●<br>●</div><p>ACQUISITIO</p></div>
    </div>

    <div class="verdict">
        ผลพยากรณ์: ACQUISITIO (โชคลาภและการได้มา)<br>
        <span style="font-size: 0.6em; color: #aaa;">สถานะ: พลังงานบวกสูง เหมาะสำหรับการทำกำไร</span>
    </div>
</div>

</body>
</html>
